  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 9 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nYour ideal family lifestyle starts right here with this fantastic single-level home positioned on a flat, easy-care section in the heart of Torbay. \r\n\r\nDesigned for everyday comfort, the home features three generous bedrooms, a dedicated study, one family bathroom, and a separate toilet for busy morning routines. A separate lounge flows effortlessly into a spacious, modern kitchen and dining area, opening out to a sun-drenched outdoor entertaining space and a fully fenced yard where you can relax while watching the kids and pets play. \r\n\r\nThe property also offers an unbeatable North Shore coastal lifestyle just minutes from the beaches of Long Bay Regional Park. Both Long Bay Village and Torbay Village are only a short drive away, putting vibrant cafes, restaurants, shops, and everyday amenities right at your fingertips.\r\n\r\n Zoned for highly sought-after Long Bay Primary School, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College, this stunning home is sure to attract strong interest—act quickly to make it yours.",
